# GitHub language stats count BYTES, not files. The design canvas under
# design/ is a design artifact rather than application code, and its seeded
# payload alone is ~2.3 MB — enough to report this repo as majority HTML and
# bury the TypeScript it is actually written in.
design/** linguist-documentation

# Search Console ownership stubs — not code either.
public/google*.html linguist-generated

# The committed CA certificate is base64-encoded into an app setting:
# LF everywhere, so the value is the same on every checkout.
infra/sec-ingest/certs/*.pem text eol=lf
